al networks. However, the simple RNN and LSTM neural networks could predict the target sequence perfectly with fewer recurrent units than the GRU neural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":180630,"global_rank":402044},{"name":"pratmodi/SpringAssignment","owner":"pratmodi","html_url":"https://github.com/pratmodi/SpringAssignment","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"IMCS First Spring Assignment","topics":[],"score":180630,"global_rank":402045},{"name":"pratmodi/pratmodi","owner":"pratmodi","html_url":"https://github.com/pratmodi/pratmodi","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Config files for my GitHub profile.","topics":["config","github-config"],"score":180630,"global_rank":402046},{"name":"jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","owner":"jstoecker","html_url":"https://github.com/jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Survey of DX12 compute topics","topics":[],"score":180630,"global_rank":402047},{"name":"Binyam914/Week-4---Assignments-Rock-Paper-Scissors-game","owner":"Binyam914","html_url":"https://github.com/Binyam914/Week-4---Assignments-Rock-Paper-Scissors-game","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180624,"global_rank":402049},{"name":"joshuaji03/alfred","owner":"joshuaji03","html_url":"https://github.com/joshuaji03/alfred","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"My fun personal project to create a personalized butler to track my to-dos","topics":[],"score":180624,"global_rank":402050},{"name":"lsetiawan/conda-packaging","owner":"lsetiawan","html_url":"https://github.com/lsetiawan/conda-packaging","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Repo for conda packaging","topics":[],"score":180624